cff-version: 1.3.0
message: "If you use the Agentic Presentation Builder in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: Agentic Presentation Builder
abstract: >-
  The Agentic Presentation Builder is an LLM-friendly, JSON-based presentation
  engine that renders structured deck definitions into interactive Reveal.js
  presentations with Mermaid diagrams, LaTeX math, syntax-highlighted code, and
  animated progressive reveals. It ships an apb command-line interface for
  validating, serving, and exporting decks.
